lent, or the Bank of Canada raises interest rates to defend the embattled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Some market watchers say sustained negative yield spreads between Canada and the U.S. are also a key reason for the Canadian dollar's weakness. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  06-15-98 \par \par \uc2  1109EDT \par \par \uc2  4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du6f01gat\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
