\par\par \b \uc2  Canada Morning: C$ Steady In Advance Of Thiessen Speech \b0\par\par\uc2 377 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Mai 1998\par 16:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar was little changed Wednesday as markets waited to see how a speech from Bank of Canada Governor Gordon Thiessen later in the day would affect the embattled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We did a lot of damage yesterday and people want to see if the Governor responds to that either today or in his speech tomorrow," said Avery Shenfeld, senior economist with CIBC Wood Gundy Securities Inc. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar traded at C$1.4557 at 10:24 a.m. EDT (1424 GMT), from C$1.4552 at 8:00 a.m. EDT (1200 GMT), and from C$1.4546 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  After trading a tight range in recent sessions, the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  took a serious tumble on Tuesday, with the U.S. dollar climbing from its Monday close of C$1.4492 to about C$1.4560 before the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , selling U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an effort to contain market volatility. \par \par \uc2  Thiessen is scheduled to speak in Montreal at around 1:15 p.m. EDT (1715 GMT), but the text of his speech will be released around 11:45 a.m. EDT (1545 GMT). He also speaks to the House of Commons standing committe on finance Thursday morning. \par \par \uc2  Market watchers said the beseiged Canadian dollar was getting a respite before Thiessen's speech. "They're giving him a change to perhaps rise to the occasion and warn markets about a possible rate response if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gets much weaker," Shenfeld said. \par \par \uc2  One \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader with a major Canadian bank said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was benefitting from "a consensus that he's not going to say much that's going to be that harmful to the Canadian dollar." \par \par \uc2  While the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is understandably reluctant to tighten rates in light of current economic conditions, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's weakness may ultimately test its patience, Shenfeld observed. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 10:24 a.m. EDT (1424 GMT), 8:00 a.m.\par EDT (1200 GMT) and late Tuesday.\par    U.S./CDN    1.4557      1.4552       1.4546\par    CDN/DEM     1.2249      1.2122       1.2168\par    CDN/YEN     94.61       94.47        94.71\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 27-05-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1427GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5r04ii8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
