dian unit lower. \par \par \uc2  "I think players out there are still biased to try and test the (U.S. dollar) upside. It just might take a little longer then people originally thought," he said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 3:33 p.m. EDT (1933 GMT), 8:00 a.m.\par EDT (1200 GMT) and late Wednesday.\par    U.S./CDN    1.4480      1.4493       1.4446\par    CDN/DEM     1.2276      1.2251       1.2311\par    CDN/YEN     92.28       92.50        92.81\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-05-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1945GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5e043hb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
