30-35.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  04-13-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1332EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du4d00y8y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
