 could keep the U.S. dollar to a range this session between C$1.4405 and C$1.4445. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 9:37 a.m. EST (1437 GMT), 8:00 a.m.\par EST (1300 GMT) and late Tuesday.\par    U.S./CDN    1.4421     1.4408     1.4415\par    CDN/DEM     1.2691     1.2711     1.2752\par    CDN/YEN     88.70      88.60      89.08\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1513GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1l00kxc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
