\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2: Typical Smoothing  \highlight22\uc2 Operation \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 1998\par 15:11\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market Tuesday to sell U.S. dollars at\par C$1.4305 at around 8:51 a.m. EST (1351 GMT) in an effort to\par smooth out trading action, said a trader in Toronto.\par    In overnight trading, the U.S. dollar moved up from the\par Monday close at C$1.4237, forcing the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's hand.\par Its unofficial policy is to stand against intraday moves in\par either direction of 70 ticks or more.\par    Throughout the month of December the BOC was prompted\par repeatedly to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the Canadian dollar's defense as\par the troubles in the Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets, and a dramatic\par widening of the country's current-account deficit conspired\par to unsettle it. It spent just under C$2.0 billion in the\par process, according to figures released earlier Tuesday.\par    In the last week of 1997, the U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  dollar retreated\par sharply from an almost 12-year high at C$1.4416, but many\par dealers remain unconvinced that the new levels can hold for\par long without more substantial demand. Some technical\par analysts say there will be another test of that high, with\par the all-time U.S. dollar record at C$1.4465 the ultimate\par target. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  did not \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  during the U.S.\par dollar's move downward in the past few sessions.\par    Others say there is fair interest for the Canadian\par dollar at the C$1.4305 level, which cap the current run. The\par U.S. dollar traded at C$1.4303 at 9:06 a.m. EST.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  01-06-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0911EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du16001o8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
